 "name_en": "Lease-Out for Sublease Accounting – Group Ledger IFRS (2SA)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Lease-Out for Sublease Accounting – Group Ledger IFRS (2SA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio4fc01e50327c4a77bb66b13ebb515c6a\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4fc01e50327c4a77bb66b13ebb515c6a__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item supports the lease-out scenario in a sublease contract.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">A sublease is a lease agreement between a lessee who already holds a lease contract and another party called the sublessee who wants to use of the object of the original lease contract. The lessee assigns or gives certain rights to the sublessee that are held under the terms of the original lease with the owner.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">In a lease-out scenario, the lessee who already has a lease-in contract with the lessor, creates a lease-out contract that includes the IFRS 16 compliant valuation to support the sublease option.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4fc01e50327c4a77bb66b13ebb515c6a__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio4fc01e50327c4a77bb66b13ebb515c6a__ul_f5s_ntj_w1c\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create sublease-out contract and add valuation rule</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform period posting for sublease-out contract and adjustment (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Terminate sublease-out contract</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute reports for Contract Management, Valuation Management, Accounting and Adjustments</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4fc01e50327c4a77bb66b13ebb515c6a__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Support compliance requirements for lease-out scenarios</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Support comprehensive leasing processes within IFRS 16</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Standardize and automate your recurring lease administration activities</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Gain full control and visibility of leases and critical dates</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor critical dates on your leases, such as lease notifications and renewal</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>子租赁会计核算的租出 - 集团分类账 IFRS (2SA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio4fc01e50327c4a77bb66b13ebb515c6a\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4fc01e50327c4a77bb66b13ebb515c6a__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持子租赁合同中的租赁协议场景。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">子租赁是已持有租赁合同的承租人与另一方（想要使用原始租赁合同对象的子承租人）之间的租赁协议。承租人向子承租人转让或授予特定权利，这些权利根据与所有者签订的原始租赁条款而保留。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">在租赁协议场景中，已与出租人签订租入合同的承租人创建包含 IFRS 16 合规性评估的租出合同，以支持子租赁选项。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4fc01e50327c4a77bb66b13ebb515c6a__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio4fc01e50327c4a77bb66b13ebb515c6a__ul_f5s_ntj_w1c\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建子租赁协议合同并添加评估规则</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行合同外子租赁的期间过账和调整（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">终止子租赁协议合同</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行合同管理、评估管理、会计核算和调整报表</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4fc01e50327c4a77bb66b13ebb515c6a__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">支持租赁协议场景的合规性要求</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">支持 IFRS 16 内的全面租赁流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">标准化和自动化周期性租赁管理活动</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">获得租赁和关键日期的完全控制和可见性。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控租赁的关键日期，例如租赁通知和续订</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
